'''Revenge of the Dreamer (Merciless)''' is the second stage in [[A Deeper Dream]]. When clearing this stage, the player is guaranteed to unlock the [[True Form]] of [[Lone Cat and Kitten (Rare Cat)|Lone Cat and Kitten]], Tourist Cat. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

